    {
      "source": "Save the entity to couchbase.<br/>\nIf there is no version property on the entity class, and this is in a transaction, use insert. <br/>\nIf there is no version property on the entity class, and this is not in a transaction, use upsert. <br/>\nIf there is a version property on the entity class, and it is non-zero, then this is an existing document, use\nreplace.<br/>\nOtherwise, there is a version property for the entity, but it is zero or null, use insert. <br/>",
      "translation": "将实体保存到 Couchbase。<br/>\n如果实体类上没有版本属性，且处于事务中，则使用 insert。<br/>\n如果实体类上没有版本属性，且不在事务中，则使用 upsert。<br/>\n如果实体类上有版本属性且其值非零，则表示这是一个现有文档，请使用 replace。<br/>\n否则，实体具有版本属性但其值为零或 null，请使用 insert。<br/>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Tries to convert the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a> into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a> but returns the original\nexception if the conversation failed.",
      "translation": "尝试将给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a> 转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.dao 中的类或接口\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a>，但如果转换失败，则返回原始异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Tries to convert the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a> into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a> but returns the original\nexception if the conversation failed. Thus allows safe re-throwing of the return value.",
      "translation": "尝试将给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a> 转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/dao/DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a>，但如果转换失败则返回原始异常。因此可以安全地重新抛出返回值。",
      "count": 1
    },
